# The cf-platform fixture ships dist/index.html verbatim so the Workers-
# with-static-assets shape has a real static asset to serve. The
# repo-level .gitignore excludes dist/ globally; this exception keeps the
# fixture's dist/ tracked. The runtime probe reports under .rcf/reports/
# are runtime artefacts and stay gitignored.
!dist/
!dist/**
.rcf/reports/
.wrangler/
